```

**Risk:** 7 distinct production methods — when this fails, you cannot quickly identify the culprit. One assertion covers 7 behaviors.

**Fix:** Test each step in isolation. If a workflow test is desired, mark it explicitly as an integration test:
```csharp
[TestMethod]
[TestCategory("Integration")]
public void OrderProcessor_FullWorkflow_Succeeds() { /* ... */ }
