**8. Sensitive Equality** — `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 122)

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

**Risk:** If `ToString()` formatting changes (locale, spacing, currency symbol), this breaks even though the actual summary data is correct.

**Fix:** Assert on structured properties instead:
```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
Assert.AreEqual(1, summary.ItemCount);
