### Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Rationale |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | Assertion-Free Test | 5 min | Silent false-pass — highest risk of hiding bugs |
| 2 | Sleepy Test | 10 min | Flaky CI + 2 s wasted per run |
| 3 | Mystery Guest | 10 min | Tests cannot pass outside one machine |
| 4 | Conditional Test Logic | 10 min | Unknown branch coverage gap |
| 5 | Exception Handling | 5 min | Straightforward mechanical fix |
| 6 | Sensitive Equality | 10 min | Fragile to formatting changes |
| 7 | Eager Test | 15 min | Refactor into focused unit tests or tag as integration |
| 8 | Magic Number Test | 15 min | Readability; derive expected values from named inputs |
| 9 | General Fixture | 2 min | Remove one unused field |

